# 10 - POINTS, BADGES, AND LEADERBOARDS
# Run after review creation and final escrow transitions.
# Expected final totals for this workflow: buyer 23 points and seller 24 points.
# Access tokens expire after 15 minutes; rerun buyer login in file 01 and seller login in file 02 if needed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@buyerToken = PASTE_BUYER_JWT_HERE
@sellerToken = PASTE_POST_APPROVAL_SELLER_JWT_HERE

### VIEW BUYER POINTS AND BADGES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/engagement/me
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW BUYER IMMUTABLE POINT LEDGER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/engagement/me/points?page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW SELLER POINTS AND BADGES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/engagement/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW BUYER LEADERBOARD
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leaderboards/BUYER?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW SELLER LEADERBOARD
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/leaderboards/SELLER?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json
